      "id": "582df44c-baf6-43bd-9d02-0550fe083fe3",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "# **Stack Using Array**",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "582df44c-baf6-43bd-9d02-0550fe083fe3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "751581c3-4edb-4a33-9a28-6300bc840c58",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 1.Creation of Stack and Basic Operation",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "751581c3-4edb-4a33-9a28-6300bc840c58"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a64fcf8f-3649-42c5-ae08-de09ffba12ef",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "public class StackEmptyException extends Exception{\r\n}\r\n\r\npublic class StackUsingArray {\r\n    private int data[];\r\n    private int top;\r\n\r\n    public StackUsingArray(){\r\n        this.data = new int[10];\r\n        this.top = -1;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // For pushing into stack\r\n    public void push(int data){\r\n        if(top == this.data.length - 1){\r\n           doubleCapacity();\r\n        }\r\n        top += 1;\r\n        this.data[top] = data;\r\n\r\n\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // To delete top element from stack\r\n    public int pop(){\r\n        if(top == -1){\r\n        //    throw new StackEmptyException();\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        return this.data[top--];\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // To get the top most element\r\n    public int top() throws StackEmptyException{\r\n        if(top == -1){\r\n            // throw new StackEmptyException();\r\n        }\r\n        return this.data[top];\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // To get the size of stack\r\n    public int size(){\r\n        return top + 1;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // To find if stack is empty\r\n    public boolean isEmpty(){\r\n        return top == -1;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // To double the capacity when stack is full\r\n    private void doubleCapacity(){\r\n        int temp[] = this.data;\r\n        this.data = new int[2 * temp.length];\r\n\r\n        for(int i = 0; i < temp.length; i++){\r\n            this.data[i] = temp[i];\r\n        }\r\n\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java",
        "executionSummary": {
          "executionOrder": 13,
          "success": true
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 13,
      "outputs": [
