        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d4d6eff6-af23-48c9-89b5-be28971e24c8",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## 2. To print the elements of stack",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "d4d6eff6-af23-48c9-89b5-be28971e24c8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1690475e-0f8b-4cfc-afbd-109daceeeef8",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "public void print(StackUsingArray s){\r\n        \r\n        while(!s.isEmpty()){\r\n            System.out.println(s.pop());\r\n        }\r\n    \r\n}\r\n\r\n        // Remember stack will become empty after poping all elements",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java",
